# Local overrides for the worker service. Copy to .env (ignored by git).
PORT=8081
# Set by scripts/deploy-service.sh on Cloud Run; "dev" when unset.
# GIT_SHA=
# Secrets come from Secret Manager on Cloud Run (--set-secrets), never from the repo.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides of the model aliases in worker/src/gemini/client.ts
# (defaults: gemini-pro-latest for extraction, gemini-flash-latest for classification).
# GEMINI_PRO_MODEL=
# GEMINI_FLASH_MODEL=
# Firebase Admin: project and the bucket that holds uploads (users/{uid}/documents/{docId}).
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# STORAGE_BUCKET=
# Runs (POST /runs, spec 07). Cloud Tasks calls the endpoint with an OIDC token whose audience
# is the worker's URL; set TASKS_AUDIENCE (or WORKER_URL) to it, and TASKS_SERVICE_ACCOUNT to
# the invoker account to accept only its tokens. TASKS_AUTH=off skips the check for local runs.
# TASKS_AUDIENCE=https://worker-xyz-as.a.run.app
# TASKS_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=tasks-invoker@adidi-ai-cup-builder-2026.iam.gserviceaccount.com
# TASKS_AUTH=off
